TEXT
00│  Welcome to Proqi, a prompt composer designed to replace common agent│
01│  input methods. Capture, refine, organize, and submit prompts here.│
02│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
03│  Press Enter to edit the focused thought. Press Esc to return to board│
04│  mode. In edit mode, press Primary+Shift+U to delete the containing│
05│  sentence.│
06│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
07│  Press n to create a new thought, or paste in board mode to create one│
08│  from the pasted text.│
09│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
10│  Use j or ↓ to move to the next thought, and k or ↑ to move to the│
11│  previous one. Press d to delete the focused thought and u to undo.│
12│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
13│⋮ Proqi works on its own. Herdr adds a power-user workflow for│
14││
15│  proqi-ui-first-run│
16│  6 thoughts · board · saved│
17│  n New   y Copy  x Cut  d/Del  Space Select u Undo  / Search│

